{
  "6": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cf8d6f72c7949a3443978353cc85a491239638e9131934be02996dc89725b3ee",
      "text": "All right, cleaning done~!\nThanks, Penelone! You were\na huge help!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e56f483a84939997454e54e7f24b3dea76382d309648b3f77b986e7cee7af445",
      "text": "Hee hee, leave it to me. Thanks to\nall of you, I've mastered how to\ncontrol my power, you see.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4d05d253fcb6bdda670d719fa254b5f5897f26e0b62b4a98d7fa2bd808a39773",
      "text": "You seem to be in a good mood.\nDid something nice happen?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "19": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b7bdd043bf36f1efe117d110333217f3d3bbe43244179bd5c6de23e2d5952ee7",
      "text": "Actually... tomorrow, Father and\nMother finally have a day off from\nwork...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "23": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:743421b62ca66dcccf85a63fd46918fc29a4d3e5cabe1c0c710e4bd93a3f70ee",
      "text": "Oh, I see...! That would make\nanyone happy.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e2d72325c9df12a09c40926a14c8b228eb9ddc8fb97fd11d78c3fd2656360b73",
      "text": "Yes...! We'll eat together, talk,\nread picture books... There's so\nmuch I want to do!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "32": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9bd564586fa54134f4f1efd95bacfc4f873063df3256be69e238e20297ae55cf",
      "text": "Thanks for cleaning! ...It\nall worked out nicely.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:867b3b50b8479e9ec6c625314de6b4b80306fcf27914deac9c6a6da84898037a",
      "text": "This is a cake I just made. Would you\ntake it as thanks for the cleaning?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:abe722408eb09f786434eb65cf2bc289022268b495e60ed279d485c26b96e8dc",
      "text": "B-but I didn't help in order to get\na reward, you see...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d3f256ccbbba132729614145736339763084130e6f7099b6519ea4aeb88a5c77",
      "text": "Oh, it's actually a new recipe.\nI'd like your thoughts. And\nyour parents', if you like.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "47": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2fb3e48656626ab357e1fb87c8e1ddc78cadc464ffbba7944d228f4dde155133",
      "text": "Cake... with Father and Mother...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "51": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2bb71d7ccd81bc1159c486ee90754d3e67b006d24f284bbce4a8d911503c0730",
      "text": "Big bro. Surely there's a cake for\nNao, too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "55": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9a06b8bd787bb56a5681816879051e80950a257b24c50d3f7c142c5e7cc9c6fc",
      "text": "Yes, yes, I made one for you.\n...Penelone, want to eat another one\nnow, apart from the one to take home?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "61": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a1aa86138a824c03209ff03a15d66ed543b645133801d7b9f2a0b6644d4f73f5",
      "text": "Huh, Penelone?\nDidn't you go home...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "65": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4bf208b953d2317b975c36eace70ea9539a46c855f6876fbc33eeff1cbba178",
      "text": "...Father and Mother got sudden\nwork. So tomorrow, too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "69": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f60eca219e369f4100ebe58041e9f73bac6c98dc4523d8fc30e7544ecf1538e0",
      "text": "I-I'm fine! I'm used to it!\nI just wanted to bring back the\ncake—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a05b572350f293bd3fd18188409feac6b5de2c2085a7eec8a1d3f628e46828ce",
      "text": "Penelone.\nLet's eat cake right now!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e60a2403a6aaf461824a08bd0f0f6d4f8a18cad9903d477f509c1b6efc1cb2b5",
      "text": "Huh? B-but I ate some at\nlunchtime too...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "80": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2609e7deeb05b5002fa08f415e6deaad915d420f61a0ec334d3474a2ab16b560",
      "text": "Truth is, I wanted more~.\nAnd also, talking, reading\npicture books, all that—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "84": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ec4985d599eba5c12e2bb4dd713abce4bb1d253f57d7df93ac13077856f76090",
      "text": "Let's do it all.\nEverything you want to do, Penelone!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7e1a5c48fb2e852ec65a54193750405dfc5999e7e87d124af53e3e80bfed61b8",
      "text": "Haah... the picture book\njust now was so much fun...!\nIt touched my heart...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6449704e1670201b93c9fd991a33b15326406e4c78871ce3eb056b1a0ae78246",
      "text": "Right? Nao loves it too~.\nSomeone read it to me a\nlot when I was little.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "97": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:491ada4bae7ff86f520b83f942b176521084e5be4ec5ad6e3907d80181544617",
      "text": "All right! What shall we do next,\nPene?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8ef3ba9791efbc4ba82d90f54e4074f933f2636b62f5d943c84c553ee2f3a803",
      "text": "N-Nao. You've already played with me\nso much...! I can't depend on you\nany more than—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ad8fe0ccbcbfa17ce6d44cd060092bd914bb4705726ccf6f1b480d8aa802854a",
      "text": "Oh~, are you sure~? Nao can do\nanything right now~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3747c14e055a88ccac1976043ce06650bdcac0b20b0a2a6866f9357eff30212",
      "text": "A-anything...!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:71a8d08c7e545135043c9e0f448d49a9dcc52d32491d0b58cce1e9c5829d29f2",
      "text": "Th-then... um... I'm sorry if it's\na bother, but...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "117": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d1037c47d7067342cf2df547e1f0864f3f95dc8490633ba0b971a2dd48917e63",
      "text": "...Could you... brush me...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:784d1faf16562818aa3ae30e0a54cff08af13d5e9472a7d4c66e0e1ccc219d35",
      "text": "Here you go!\nRight this way, please!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "127": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:edbcc92aa1927fb8d56cb39b3ec364962b0c8a170e95c23c33fa9df1b99210c5",
      "text": "Any itchy spots, miss~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:34af91a5a4148bfce92c58791f3d2d8aa4156d29e80be5c72e7b5db617bf76af",
      "text": "Nyaah...\nIt's perfect~...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6e760955537b5b0f48725a001e57d62d8d1dc543ce75da666d7fb9167a25ae79",
      "text": "Nyaah~... purr purr...\n...Mother...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4795855c62300c65a05fa720eec75fa066292422d6e12ac9e9bdafa117a71823",
      "text": "S-sorry...!\nT-that was, um...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "147": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:992ab870b0ba5a6fbaf0d967eed926f02b1681184600d66ea1891949fbdcb888",
      "text": "...You really wanted your parents\nto come home, didn't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "151": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:34e842db27df0f6963d458808bb253974c0e382750becfe892223aa88ea5fd9b",
      "text": "...Will you keep it a secret from\neveryone...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:109461d2b21288f234ee5f62ba71db1db7ffcb759c39e06d01e19e277ddf7bc7",
      "text": "Of course.\nA secret just between Nao and Pene!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e88de1cb9e510314ae3548b8ff69f5fec58b58ca3125dedbf5e8226003ff6ad2",
      "text": "...I wanted them to come home.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7e628f3500d2b08095cb1cb579e54d18c064aa9bfe5b5d19e0fb33e529d7cb24",
      "text": "The brushing, the pats... And hugs,\ntoo. ...I wanted to be together\nmore...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0c6db0f4f25da10a0337d7bf6ae3b8fe34890be1881caef41e7f49904ce5de6f",
      "text": "B-but! I truly don't want to get in\nthe way of their work either. That's\nno lie...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:692f7c55be16ec9db4cf4ed7891a2e3c15e213bb238d1c2926483395fb7e265d",
      "text": "...I see. Honestly, Nao sometimes\nthinks a big bro who makes you wait\nshould be given a hard time, but—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "170": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e28b451147a00232d7df582e37feacc9e04d05a516224069c71b5857888646ec",
      "text": "Pene, you don't want to cause them\ntrouble, do you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "174": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:44c9fe8ddc6b76b9c5b5945de228aa36b7425f2f177749bd21551c2785f630a2",
      "text": "R-right! I just, just...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3d33bfaf1fc8bc087a398b6e55e7ba69536488f1ceaabf8da36b4a444e800547",
      "text": "...I want to be a wonderful grown-up.\nKind, like Mother and Father...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39b942f627f948d3f3021d8a7b6c7701f9c665464815f41df5808e9348457f4f",
      "text": "Pene. That means—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "184": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:475a2a44331cbcdb3b826c69a61068971a8a95925f95968acb6f96f40076ec81",
      "text": "If you help with your parents' work,\nspend more time together, and still\nget spoiled, that's full marks, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "189": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9aa3730b0b929e46724d8a2f634dadf687d89ef32f26e11a064269257ee3f1dd",
      "text": "F-full marks. A gold star, a perfect\nanswer...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:91bcc68f946082ba4194c2f21f3dd01b861cda7384fb176c3419b884322e161f",
      "text": "Let's do it all, Pene. Let's do such\nwonderful grown-up things that we\nleave everyone behind!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ab8d11fe1ae30ef33d5b248da38c9acad94efa191e6e9ed6c8112db1ca5b9828",
      "text": "...Everything I want to do...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0463d7af1bf519546f046143cc6dc9ce0bc747eec7f7d46ae2c562467681a09c",
      "text": "...I did wrong by Pene. I wish she'd\njust get mad at me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:110861b9c3ca2c03975bf98a97c1b7444461bd1ccdd662f1bc58efa0417cec09",
      "text": "You know how kind that girl\nis. This time, let's get\nthe work done fast and—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:140b88c358431ec37e2f135428aa7bd0156008265070ce281bfb57f468fe9e53",
      "text": "All right! That's the last one,\nright? The count checks out, too!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6781a5c4e884deef2381c09ca9ccfcce089fc3a584ad7a16f664bfe19e1a11b5",
      "text": "Yes. Perfectly finished! Thank you\nall so much!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "214": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1b1f3f41060d39a1789fda670c42c9414e12461d9aa2ca3de4c81f8099894864",
      "text": "P-Pene...!? Why are you here?\nAnd what are you doing...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "217": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fa81bad937e863e909261590e2943fce78cd26c689c10ea0e7cf77d2a2b90a9e",
      "text": "Father! Mother! I finished both of\nyour jobs for today!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "220": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1f7e3d7be2be1d45302f92d21359b9323ea1ac1fa3598b385aae6775cc91ae2b",
      "text": "Everyone helped me. So there's\nnothing left for you to do at all!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "224": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:15cb4f739ae072cbb48c6bb246724d7a5109e8a33bb9625db7d01714d9bb5574",
      "text": "—So today, please play with me\nall day long...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "227": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:83121431fd207be8afb524a9427c78f328865516c906b2eba6befc885449f2a7",
      "text": "M-Mother? Father...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "230": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7f6837f70caf6f3d38b9cb322dce28dd1884229941daaae0e74cf2a921ed0828",
      "text": "I'm sorry, I've leaned on you so\nmuch... I've wanted to do this all\nalong.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "232": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b7f8a380b5e6405a109088bed8b03c3c80998781557ee5c25b55239bb9fa3c83",
      "text": "Let's play a lot. Tell me everything\nyou want to do.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "234": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5412759ef166dd18f4795c07f73accccdb0d7f0620c9d290675a87d5944c9ba8",
      "text": "What shall we do first? Ball games,\nor cards—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "236": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:87b3ac7f76436a2791c8b79e6f75c4112b3fedff88377435f3b790a0244449dd",
      "text": "Whoa, ooh...!? P-Pene...!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "239": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:725145144f642fc9f3e1cc61c0b7627ea5879eef89246d9ca7f3030c49d56fcb",
      "text": "Hee hee. I always wanted to fly\ntogether with you, Father and Mother!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "243": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5e97292c108ee686f80d0190ba14febdb5f6ea0e8d41997ca46aec1a1964775d",
      "text": "Today, I'll do everything I want\nto do!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "246": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f0f44a040267904d760111dbb97c586077448c2d0a27cd27ecb273ef97384c4d",
      "text": "Father, Mother.\nI love you so much...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
